    LLM: "Never meld a card that doesn't also serve multiple melds. Keeping options open is critical with only 10 cards.\n\nForcing Mechanic: Offer discards that your opponent CAN use (forcing them to take unwanted cards reduces their hand flexibility). Withhold sequences that are close to completionâ€”don't let the opponent see them.\n\nFull Sequence Planning: With only 40 cards and melds visible, calculate which cards remain in stock. The endgame is a pure logic puzzleâ€”force your opponent into a position where every stock card improves only your position.",
